        <span itemprop="subject">Example 4</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">Example 5</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0000">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">Example 6</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">Resin Composition PE Resin for First Microporous Layer UHMWPE Mw (1) /% by mass 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 HDPE Mw (1) /% by mass 3.5  ⁇  10 5 /75 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /75 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /75 Resin Mixture for Second Microporous Layer UHMWPE Mw (1) /% by mass 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 HDPE Mw (1) /% by mass 3.5  ⁇  10 5 /65 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /65 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /65 Heat-resistant polymer Type PBT (9) PBT (9) TPX (10) Mw (1) /% by mass 3.8  ⁇  10 4 /10 3.8  ⁇  10 4 /10 5.2  ⁇  10 5 /10 Filler Type/% by mass (2) —/— — —/— —/— Production Conditions</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0000">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">Example 7</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">Example 8 Example 9 Resin Composition PE Resin for First Microporous Layer UHMWPE Mw (1) /% by mass 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 HDPE Mw (1) /% by mass 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /75 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /75 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /75 Resin Mixture for Second Microporous Layer UHMWPE Mw (1) /% by mass 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 2.0  ⁇  10 6 /25 HDPE Mw (1) /% by mass 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /65 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /65 5.0  ⁇  10 5 /65 Heat-resistant polymer Type PC (11) PA6 (12) PBT (9) Mw (1) /% by mass 3  ⁇  10 4 /10 1.1  ⁇  10 4 /10 3.8  ⁇  10 4 /10 Filler Type/% by mass (2) —/— — —/— —/— Production Conditions PE Resin Concentration</span>
